- **Unit Tests**: Small isolated modules for individual components.
- **Integration Tests**: Focuses on interactions among dependent systems/storages (e.g., database-level transactions).
- **End-to-End Tests**: Full workflow testing simulating realistic user journeys through APIs.

This stratification ensures comprehensive yet efficient test implementation and maintenance efforts.

